0 years. It is often referred to as \"Thoongaa Nagaram\", meaning \"the city that never sleeps\".","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Meenakshi_Amman_West_Tower.jpg/330px-Meenakshi_Amman_West_Tower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madurai"},"twins":[],"climate":{"temp":[24.7,26.9,29.9,31.3,30.8,29.5,29.2,28.9,28.6,27.4,25.4,24.3],"rain":[9,12,23,50,101,57,72,89,115,197,177,60],"cloud":[43,38,45,57,63,71,76,74,69,72,71,60]},"land":true}